You said that your plot is on a black background, so I think the plot really is there, you just cannot see it.  By default base graphics will plot black with a transparent background, so you have black on black.  Try changing your plotting colors, or specify a non-transparent background for the plot (possibly using par(bg='white') or you may need to set an option to the graphics device).  Or you could change the background of the slides so that the black shows up.

